From 98f5b922fb22f5862389c83160dbd6b7923870bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerard Balaoro <gerardbalaoro@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:44:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(branding): use G Code icons on mobile

Use the G mark for iOS and Android launchers, splashes, notifications, quick actions, widgets and live activities.
