 apps/mobile/src/widgets/AgentActivity.tsx     |   4 +-
 .../src/widgets/AgentActivityWidget.tsx       |   4 +-
 11 files changed, 36 insertions(+), 89 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 apps/mobile/assets/g-code/adaptive-foreground.png
